{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.BraidGroupNStrand","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.BraidGroupNStrand","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic","lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.BraidLinkTypes"],"declarations":41,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.closureN_eq_closure3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.closureN_eq_closure3","kind":"theorem","line":317,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidGroupNStrand.lean#L317-L321","doc":"**`closureN` at `n = 3` dispatches to `closure3`** by direct\npattern match. Closed by `rfl` from the concrete definition of\n`closureN` at `n = 3`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.closureN_eq_closure2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.closureN_eq_closure2","kind":"theorem","line":309,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidGroupNStrand.lean#L309-L313","doc":"**`closureN` at `n = 2` factors through `closure2`** via the\nwrithe. Closed by `rfl` from the concrete definition of `closureN`\nat `n = 2`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Braid2_writhe_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Braid2_writhe_eq","kind":"theorem","line":292,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidGroupNStrand.lean#L292-L299","doc":"Writhe of `Braid2.toBraidWord n` equals `n` itself: each positive\ncrossing contributes `+1` and each negative `−1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.writhe_replicate_neg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.writhe_replicate_neg","kind":"theorem","line":283,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidGroupNStrand.lean#L283-L290","doc":"Writhe of a constant replicate word: `k` negative crossings give\nwrithe `−k`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.writhe_replicate_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.writhe_replicate_pos","kind":"theorem","line":273,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidGroupNStrand.lean#L273-L281","doc":"Writhe of a constant replicate word: `k` positive crossings give\nwrithe `k`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Braid2.toBraidWord","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Braid2.toBraidWord","kind":"def","line":262,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidGroupNStrand.lean#L262-L269","doc":"Embed a `Braid2` (= ℤ) into a 2-strand `BraidWord` by listing\n`|n|` copies of σ_0 (resp. σ_0⁻¹) of the appropriate sign.\n\nConventional: positive `n : ℤ` produces `n` positive crossings of\nthe single generator σ_0 in `Fin (2 − 1) = Fin 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.MarkovTraceN.tau_stab_factor_eq_z","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.MarkovTraceN.tau_stab_factor_eq_z","kind":"theorem","line":255,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidGroupNStrand.lean#L255-L255","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.MarkovTraceN.tau_stab_factor","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.MarkovTraceN.tau_stab_factor","kind":"def","line":254,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidGroupNStrand.lean#L254-L254","doc":"M3 + M4: stabilisation factor — adding a single trailing\n`σ_n` (positive or inverse) multiplies `τ` by the Markov-Jones\nparameter `z = 1/(√q + 1/√q)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.MarkovTraceN.tau_cyclic_residual_eq_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.MarkovTraceN.tau_cyclic_residual_eq_zero","kind":"theorem","line":250,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidGroupNStrand.lean#L250-L250","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.MarkovTraceN.tau_cyclic_residual","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.MarkovTraceN.tau_cyclic_residual","kind":"def","line":249,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidGroupNStrand.lean#L249-L249","doc":"M2: per-pair `cyclic-residual` for a `(w, w')`-pair witness\nbundle. The residual is expected to vanish on every cyclic\npair; the per-instance discharge plugs in the explicit\nidentity. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.MarkovTraceN.tau_identity_eq_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.MarkovTraceN.tau_identity_eq_one","kind":"theorem","line":244,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidGroupNStrand.lean#L244-L244","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.MarkovTraceN.tau_identity","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.MarkovTraceN.tau_identity","kind":"def","line":243,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidGroupNStrand.lean#L243-L243","doc":"M1: scalar value of `τ` on the identity braid word\n(substantive content: it equals `1`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.MarkovTraceN.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.MarkovTraceN.mk","kind":"ctor","line":240,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidGroupNStrand.lean#L240-L240","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.MarkovTraceN","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.MarkovTraceN","kind":"class","line":233,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidGroupNStrand.lean#L233-L255","doc":"**Markov-trace axioms** for n-strand braids: the four Jones\naxioms M1-M4 encoded via the explicit-residual pattern. Each\nfield carries a scalar (a trace value or a stabilisation\nfactor) plus an equation pinning it to the required Markov-trace\nconstant. Per-n specialisations either inherit from a global\nMarkov-trace operator on the full inductive limit or discharge\neach equation from the underlying Hecke-algebra trace. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.markovZN_legacy","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.markovZN_legacy","kind":"def","line":221,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidGroupNStrand.lean#L221-L231","doc":"**Legacy unsafe form** of `markovZN` — `Real.sqrt q` without the\n`0 < q` hypothesis. Kept for backward compatibility with the\npre-Tier-2 callsites; new code should use one of:\n  - generic `markovZN (u : R)` with explicit `u² = q` for `[Field R]`\n    (Tier 2 — preferred; avoids `Real.sqrt` entirely)\n  - `markovZN_real (q : ℝ) (hq : 0 < q)` (Tier 5 archimedean shim)\nDo NOT migrate to `markovZN (Real.sqrt q)` — that still triggers\nthe `q-usage-positivity-implicit` warning. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.markovZN_real","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.markovZN_real","kind":"def","line":208,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidGroupNStrand.lean#L208-L219","doc":"Archimedean shim of `markovZN` with explicit positivity:\n`markovZN_real q hq = markovZN (Real.sqrt q)`.\n\n**Convention D** `z_D q = q³/(q²+1) = q² · (kernel at q)`, migrated from\nconvention C 2026-08-26 (bean `qou-cxjq`). This read `(kernel at √q)`, i.e.\n`√q/(q+1)`. The rescaled shape is the only one available: no argument\nreaches D (`no_kernel_instantiation_is_conventionD`); see\n`QOU.BraidKnot.markovZD_eq_sq_mul_kernel`. The `0 < q` hypothesis is kept for\nAPI compatibility and is now genuinely unused — convention D has no\n`Real.sqrt` in it. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.markovZN","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.markovZN","kind":"def","line":192,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidGroupNStrand.lean#L192-L206","doc":"Markov-Jones parameter (Tier 2 / generic-R form): `z = u / (u² + 1)`,\nwhere `u` is the formal square root of `q`. Mathematically equivalent\nto `1 / (u + u⁻¹)`. Use this in new code instead of `markovZN_legacy`.\n\nMatches `markovZax` from `markov-axioms-primitive.lean` so the\n`MarkovTraceInductiveLimit` bridge instance can interoperate.\n\n**This is the KERNEL, not a Markov parameter — convention-C shaped, kept\ndeliberately** (bean `qou-cxjq`, 2026-08-26). It is convention-neutral *as a\nfunction*; the convention lives in how it is instantiated. Convention D is\n**not** this at any argument — `QOU.BraidKnot.no_kernel_instantiation_is_conventionD`\nproves the kernel's real range is `[-1/2, 1/2]` while `z_D q > 1/2` for every\n`q > 1` — it is the rescaling `q² · (this kernel at q)`. Consume the `_real`\nshim below, which is convention D. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HeckeQuotient.generator_det_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HeckeQuotient.generator_det_eq","kind":"theorem","line":177,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidGroupNStrand.lean#L177-L177","doc":"Hecke quadratic root product: `det(σ_i) = −1` for every `i`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HeckeQuotient.generator_det","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HeckeQuotient.generator_det","kind":"def","line":175,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidGroupNStrand.lean#L175-L175","doc":"Determinant of every Hecke generator (scalar invariant). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HeckeQuotient.generator_trace_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HeckeQuotient.generator_trace_eq","kind":"theorem","line":173,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidGroupNStrand.lean#L173-L173","doc":"Hecke quadratic root sum: `tr(σ_i) = q − q⁻¹` for every `i`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HeckeQuotient.generator_trace","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HeckeQuotient.generator_trace","kind":"def","line":171,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidGroupNStrand.lean#L171-L171","doc":"Trace of every Hecke generator (scalar invariant). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HeckeQuotient.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HeckeQuotient.mk","kind":"ctor","line":169,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidGroupNStrand.lean#L169-L169","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HeckeQuotient","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HeckeQuotient","kind":"class","line":159,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidGroupNStrand.lean#L159-L177","doc":"**Hecke quadratic relation** axiomatised for every generator via\nthe explicit-residual pattern: the class carries the substantive\nscalar invariants (trace and determinant of each generator) and\nasserts they take the Hecke-quadratic root sum/product values\n(`q − q⁻¹` and `−1`).\n\nConcrete instances at small `n` plug in the values directly; at\n`n = 3` on `V_(2,1)` these are discharged by\n`hoefsmit_sigma{0,1}_hecke_quadratic` matrix-level proofs in\n`hoefsmit-V21-cos-symmetrization.lean`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.closureN","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.closureN","kind":"def","line":142,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidGroupNStrand.lean#L142-L151","doc":"**Markov closure** of an n-strand braid word to a link.\n\nDispatches:\nn = 2 → `closure2 w.writhe`  (`rem:braid-link-types`)\nn = 3 → `closure3 w`         (Borromean at the canonical word)\nn ≥ 4 → `Link.unknot`        (placeholder for higher-n) ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.closure3_borromean","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.closure3_borromean","kind":"theorem","line":126,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidGroupNStrand.lean#L126-L132","doc":"**The canonical Borromean braid word Markov-closes to the\nBorromean link.** Closed by `if_pos rfl` on the definition of\n`closure3`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.closure3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.closure3","kind":"def","line":117,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidGroupNStrand.lean#L117-L122","doc":"**3-strand Markov closure** for the canonical Borromean word.\nDefined by direct equality check against the canonical word;\nother 3-strand words fall through to `Link.unknot` (placeholder\npending the general 3-strand closure algorithm). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.borromeanBraidWord3_writhe","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.borromeanBraidWord3_writhe","kind":"theorem","line":110,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidGroupNStrand.lean#L110-L115","doc":"The canonical Borromean braid word has writhe `0` (3 positive,\n3 negative crossings). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.borromeanBraidWord3_length","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.borromeanBraidWord3_length","kind":"theorem","line":106,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidGroupNStrand.lean#L106-L108","doc":"The canonical Borromean braid word has length `6`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.borromeanBraidWord3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.borromeanBraidWord3","kind":"def","line":100,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidGroupNStrand.lean#L100-L104","doc":"The canonical Borromean braid word in `B_3` (6 alternating\ncrossings, writhe 0). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.BraidWord.writhe_cons","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.BraidWord.writhe_cons","kind":"theorem","line":85,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidGroupNStrand.lean#L85-L89","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.BraidWord.writhe_nil","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.BraidWord.writhe_nil","kind":"theorem","line":83,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidGroupNStrand.lean#L83-L83","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.BraidWord.writhe","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.BraidWord.writhe","kind":"def","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidGroupNStrand.lean#L79-L81","doc":"Net writhe (signed crossing count) of a braid word. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.BraidWord","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.BraidWord","kind":"def","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidGroupNStrand.lean#L73-L75","doc":"An n-strand braid word — list of typed crossings. The empty list\nis the identity braid. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.instDecidableEqBraidCrossing","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.instDecidableEqBraidCrossing","kind":"instance","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidGroupNStrand.lean#L69-L69","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.instDecidableEqBraidCrossing.decEq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.instDecidableEqBraidCrossing.decEq","kind":"def","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidGroupNStrand.lean#L69-L69","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.instReprBraidCrossing.repr","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.instReprBraidCrossing.repr","kind":"def","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidGroupNStrand.lean#L69-L69","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.instReprBraidCrossing","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.instReprBraidCrossing","kind":"instance","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidGroupNStrand.lean#L69-L69","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.BraidCrossing.positive","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.BraidCrossing.positive","kind":"def","line":68,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidGroupNStrand.lean#L68-L68","doc":"Sign of the crossing: `true` = positive (`σ_i`), `false` = inverse. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.BraidCrossing.gen","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.BraidCrossing.gen","kind":"def","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidGroupNStrand.lean#L66-L66","doc":"Generator index `i` in `σ_i`, valued in `Fin (n − 1)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.BraidCrossing.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.BraidCrossing.mk","kind":"ctor","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidGroupNStrand.lean#L64-L64","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.BraidCrossing","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.BraidCrossing","kind":"structure","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidGroupNStrand.lean#L62-L69","doc":"A typed crossing in `B_n`: which generator (index `i : Fin (n − 1)`)\nand which sign (`positive` for σ_i, `negative` for σ_i⁻¹). ","signatureChunk":0}]}